short regularly.\n- **Candidate 2:** about 1.2 on item 0 but only 1.0 on item 1.\n- **Candidate 5 (about 1.2 on both):** the surplus builds up and partly spoils. On day 22 both items arrive together (about 53 + 142 plus what is already on hand), which nears the 208-unit capacity, so some item 1 may be lost.\n- **Candidate 1:** about 1.1 on both, a reasonable level.\n- **Candidate 7:** about 1.15 on both, and it cuts orders near the end (days 22–26), where leftovers are worth nothing.\n\nI rank candidate 7 first, then 1, then 5."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4348, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2305, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4348}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T21:44:13.793Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVN7Z2Q1hMKTgDiJRpb5"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_017qf2djYJBLeNeESvWisCMH", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVN7ZFHmL9Ed7dKFHBo7", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_017qf2djYJBLeNeESvWisCMH", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.05, 0.25, 0.1, 0.02, 0.04, 0.17, 0.04, 0.33]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4348, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2305, "cache_creat